{"id":353,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"There’s a proverb that says, “Shun the house where Shuppet gather in the growing dusk.”"},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It eats up emotions like malice, jealousy, and resentment, so some people are grateful for its presence."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Shuppet grows by feeding on dark emotions, such as vengefulness and envy, in the hearts of people. It roams through cities in search of grudges that taint people."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Shuppet is attracted by feelings of jealousy and vindictiveness. If someone develops strong feelings of vengeance, this Pokémon will appear in a swarm and line up beneath the eaves of that person’s home."},{"games":["Y","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice-- or so it’s said. It’s very active at night."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It feeds on the dark emotions of sadness and hatred, which make it grow steadily stronger."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It loves to feed on feelings like envy and malice. Its upright horn catches the emotions of people."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"This POKéMON roams about deep in the night seeking such negative emotions as grudges and envy. It retreats to its nest when the sun begins to rise."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Insomnia","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's insomnia prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Frisk","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can check an opposing Pokémon's held item."},{"name":"Cursed Body","hidden":true,"description":"May disable a move that has dealt damage to the Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"urban","color":"Black","shape":